  "description": "The adorable youngest member of a rising idol group has one devoted, well-known fan who harbors a secret: his ultimate bias is none other than his childhood friend. Constantly anxious about having his identity exposed, he continues supporting him from the shadows until he makes a cryptic remark at a fan signing event. Suddenly, his feelings begin to change, blurring the line between being his fan and being his childhood friend.",
